  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CBI: Vietnam Aquaculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to strengthen the sustainability of the Vietnamese shrimp sector by improving market access for Vietnamese SMES, with a focus on connecting sustainable premium shrimp from the Mekong Delta to Dutch and European markets. By promoting sector collaboration, enhancing competitiveness, scaling of sustainable shrimp production and developing a national brand for premium shrimp, the project will increase the recognition of Vietnam as a destination to source sustainable shrimp from as well as supporting SMEs in their sustainable production and export.</narrative>
  </description>
